<title>USA: First Bancshares to buy back shares.</title>
<headline>First Bancshares to buy back shares.</headline>
<dateline>MOUNTAIN GROVE, Mo. 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Bancshares Inc Friday it plans to repurchase 108,523 shares, or about 10 percent of its outstanding common stock.  </p>
<p>The company will begin repurchasing stock when it completes a separate buyback under which it plans to buy back 5,148 shares, the company said.</p>
<p>The new repurchase program is expected to be completed within a year, after which time the company will decide whether to terminate or continue it, First Bancshares said.</p>
<p>	 ((--Reuter Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
